{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"group-auth-core","type":"group","label":"👤 1. User & Identity Entity","x":-520,"y":-320,"width":450,"height":450,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-user","type":"text","text":"### 👤 Table: `User`\n\n| Column | Type | Constraints / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 🔑 `id` | `String` | `@id @default(uuid())` |\n| 📧 `email` | `String` | `@unique` (Validated) |\n| 🔒 `passwordHash` | `String` | bcrypt salted hash |\n| 👤 `name` | `String?` | Optional display name |\n| 🕒 `createdAt` | `DateTime` | `@default(now())` |\n| 🕒 `updatedAt` | `DateTime` | `@updatedAt` |\n\n**Relations:**\n- `products`: `Product[]` (1:N)\n- `invoices`: `Invoice[]` (1:N)","x":-480,"y":-260,"width":380,"height":360,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"group-inventory","type":"group","label":"📦 2. Product Inventory Entity","x":40,"y":-320,"width":460,"height":520,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-product","type":"text","text":"### 📦 Table: `Product`\n\n| Column | Type | Constraints / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 🔑 `id` | `String` | `@id @default(uuid())` |\n| 👤 `userId` | `String` | `FK -> User.id` |\n| 🏷️ `sku` | `String` | `@@unique([userId, sku])` |\n| 📝 `name` | `String` | Required product name |\n| 📄 `description` | `String?` | Optional notes |\n| 💰 `unitPrice` | `Int` | Integer minor units (>= 0) |\n| 📊 `quantityOnHand` | `Int` | Integer stock (>= 0) |\n| 🕒 `createdAt` | `DateTime` | `@default(now())` |\n| 🕒 `updatedAt` | `DateTime` | `@updatedAt` |\n\n**Relations & Rules:**\n- `user`: `User` (`@relation`) \n- `invoiceItems`: `InvoiceItem[]`\n- 🛡️ *Delete restricted if referenced in invoice*","x":80,"y":-260,"width":380,"height":430,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"group-invoices","type":"group","label":"🧾 3. Invoice Header Entity","x":-520,"y":240,"width":450,"height":580,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node-invoice","type":"text","text":"### 🧾 Table: `Invoice`\n\n| Column | Type | Constraints / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 🔑 `id` | `String` | `@id @default(uuid())` |\n| 👤 `userId` | `String` | `FK -> User.id` |\n| 🔢 `invoiceNumber` | `String` | `@unique` (e.g. `INV-2026-0001`) |\n| 🏢 `customerName` | `String` | Required |\n| 📅 `issueDate` | `DateTime` | `@default(now())` |\n| 📅 `dueDate` | `DateTime` | Required |\n| 🏷️ `status` | `InvoiceStatus` | `Enum (Default: DRAFT)` |\n| 📝 `notes` | `String?` | Optional |\n| 💵 `subtotal` | `Int` | Server-calculated integer |\n| 📈 `taxRate` | `Int` | Default 11 (11% PPN) |\n| 💸 `taxAmount` | `Int` | Server-calculated integer |\n| 💰 `total` | `Int` | Subtotal + TaxAmount |\n| 🕒 `createdAt` | `DateTime` | `@default(now())` |\n| 🕒 `updatedAt` | `DateTime` | `@updatedAt` |\n\n**Relations:**\n- `items`: `InvoiceItem[]` (Cascade delete)","x":-480,"y":300,"width":380,"height":490,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"group-invoice-items","type":"group","label":"🛒 4. Invoice Line Item Entity (Snapshot)","x":40,"y":240,"width":460,"height":580,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-invoice-item","type":"text","text":"### 🛒 Table: `InvoiceItem`\n\n| Column | Type | Constraints / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 🔑 `id` | `String` | `@id @default(uuid())` |\n| 🧾 `invoiceId` | `String` | `FK -> Invoice.id` (Cascade) |\n| 📦 `productId` | `String` | `FK -> Product.id` (Restrict) |\n| 🏷️ `productName` | `String` | **Snapshot** on creation |\n| 💰 `unitPrice` | `Int` | **Snapshot** on creation |\n| 🔢 `quantity` | `Int` | Integer (> 0) |\n| 💵 `lineTotal` | `Int` | `quantity * unitPrice` |\n| 🕒 `createdAt` | `DateTime` | `@default(now())` |\n\n**Snapshot Integrity:**\n- Changing master product price/name will **not** alter existing line item data.","x":80,"y":300,"width":380,"height":490,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"group-enums","type":"group","label":"🏷️ 5. Enums & Types","x":-520,"y":860,"width":450,"height":260,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node-invoice-status","type":"text","text":"### 🏷️ Enum: `InvoiceStatus`\n\n| Value | Description | Allowed Next States |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| ⚪ `DRAFT` | Initial state (editable) | `ISSUED`, `CANCELLED` |\n| 🟡 `ISSUED` | Stock decremented | `PAID`, `CANCELLED` |\n| 🟢 `PAID` | Terminal finalized | None (Immutable) |\n| 🔴 `CANCELLED` | Terminal canceled | None (Immutable) |","x":-480,"y":910,"width":380,"height":180,"color":"3"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"edge-user-products","fromNode":"node-user","fromSide":"right","toNode":"node-product","toSide":"left","label":"1 : N (User owns Products)"},
		{"id":"edge-user-invoices","fromNode":"node-user","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"node-invoice","toSide":"top","label":"1 : N (User owns Invoices)"},
		{"id":"edge-invoice-items","fromNode":"node-invoice","fromSide":"right","toNode":"node-invoice-item","toSide":"left","label":"1 : N (OnDelete: Cascade)"},
		{"id":"edge-product-items","fromNode":"node-product","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"node-invoice-item","toSide":"top","label":"1 : N (OnDelete: Restrict)"},
		{"id":"edge-invoice-status","fromNode":"node-invoice","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"node-invoice-status","toSide":"top","label":"Status Attribute"}
	]
}